## Failures and how to do differently

- Symptom: a full REA/ASAR analysis times out, runs out of heap, or reports a declared-vs-observed native-addon mismatch -> retain the discrepancy and unknown cause; segment the analysis instead of inferring tampering/corruption or retrying the same monolith. [Task 1][Task 2]
