- Symptom: a broad repair looks green -> cause: focused checks and a checkpoint were mistaken for all live/provider/OS lifecycle acceptance -> keep two protocol/detached-writer gaps, real-model multi-turn behavior, and OS updater/shutdown handshake explicitly open until directly tested. [Task 2]
